<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0"><title>Sahani Digital Cable | High-Speed Internet & Digital TV</title><script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css"><script>tailwind.config={theme:{extend:{colors:{primary:'#1E40AF',secondary:'#F59E0B',light:'#F3F4F6'}}}}</script><style>body{font-family:Inter,sans-serif}</style></head><body class="bg-light text-gray-800 antialiased"><nav class="fixed w-full z-50 bg-primary/95 shadow-md"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 h-20 flex justify-between items-center"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><div class="bg-secondary text-white p-2 rounded-lg"><i class="fa-solid fa-wifi text-xl"></i></div><div><span class="font-bold text-2xl text-white block">SAHANI</span><span class="text-xs text-gray-300 uppercase tracking-widest">Digital Cable</span></div></div><div class="hidden md:flex items-center space-x-6 text-white"><a href="#home" class="hover:text-secondary">Home</a><a href="#plans" class="hover:text-secondary">Plans</a><a href="#contact" class="hover:text-secondary">Contact</a></div></div></nav><section id="home" class="pt-32 pb-20 bg-primary text-white text-center px-4"><h1 class="text-5xl font-extrabold mb-6">Connect to the Future with SDC</h1><p class="text-xl mb-10 opacity-90">Ultra-fast fiber internet and premium digital entertainment.</p><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4"><a href="tel:+9779802059652" class="bg-white text-primary px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-bold text-lg"><i class="fa-solid fa-phone mr-2"></i>Call Now</a><a href="https://wa.me/9779802059652" target="_blank" class="bg-green-500 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-bold text-lg"><i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp mr-2"></i>WhatsApp Chat</a></div></section><section id="plans" class="py-20 bg-white"><div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4"><h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-center mb-12">Our Internet Plans</h2><div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8"><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border bg-gray-50"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold">SDC Basic</h3><p class="text-3xl font-bold my-4">Rs. 800<span class="text-sm font-normal">/mo</span></p><p>50 Mbps Speed</p></div><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border bg-gray-50"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold">SDC Standard</h3><p class="text-3xl font-bold my-4">Rs. 900<span class="text-sm font-normal">/mo</span></p><p>75 Mbps Speed</p></div><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border bg-blue-900 text-white"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold">SDC Premium</h3><p class="text-3xl font-bold my-4">Rs. 1,050<span class="text-sm font-normal">/mo</span></p><p>100 Mbps Speed</p></div><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border bg-gray-50"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold">SDC Ultra</h3><p class="text-3xl font-bold my-4">Rs. 1,400<span class="text-sm font-normal">/mo</span></p><p>200 Mbps Speed</p></div><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border bg-gray-50"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold">SDC Premium Ultra</h3><p class="text-3xl font-bold my-4">Rs. 1,750<span class="text-sm font-normal">/mo</span></p><p>300 Mbps Speed</p></div><div class="p-8 rounded-2xl border bg-gray-50"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Business Fiber</h3><p class="text-2xl font-bold my-4">Contact Us</p><p>Dedicated Bandwidth</p></div></div></div></section><section id="contact" class="py-20 bg-light"><div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 bg-white p-10 rounded-3xl shadow-xl"><h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6">Send us a Message</h2><form action="https://formsubmit.co/info@sahanidigitalcable.com.np" method="POST"><input type="hidden" name="_captcha" value="false"><input type="hidden" name="_template" value="table"><div class="mb-4"><label class="block mb-2 font-medium">Full Name</label><input type="text" name="name" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 border rounded-lg"></div><div class="mb-4"><label class="block mb-2 font-medium">Phone Number</label><input type="tel" name="phone" placeholder="+977" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 border rounded-lg"></div><div class="mb-4"><label class="block mb-2 font-medium">Interested Service</label><select name="service" class="w-full px-4 py-3 border rounded-lg"><option>High-Speed Internet</option><option>Digital Cable TV</option></select></div><button type="submit" class="w-full bg-primary text-white py-4 rounded-lg font-bold">Submit Request</button></form></div></section></body></html>